# 统一换行符：仓库内与各平台工作区一律使用 LF，避免 Windows/macOS 间出现整文件换行符差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.onnx binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.msix binary
